# tests/registry: the suite registry tests/run reads. One suite per line:
#
#   name|make target|artifact prerequisites|runtime tools|member of all
#
# The make target both builds the suite's artifacts and runs it; until the
# suite bodies move out of the root Makefile, the prerequisites field is `-`
# because the target carries its own. The runtime tools are the external
# commands the suite needs beyond the build toolchain; `-` means none. The
# last field marks membership in `tests/run all`.
